<title>ISRAEL: One killed in Israeli blast said to be criminal.</title>
<headline>One killed in Israeli blast said to be criminal.</headline>
<dateline>JERUSALEM 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>A car bomb explosion in the Tel Aviv suburb of Bnei Brak killed one person and lightly injured two others on Tuesday, Israel Radio said.</p>
<p>It quoted police as saying the background of the blast was apparently criminal. It said the man killed may have been the one who tried to open a door of the car.</p>
</text>
